              ? "Complete aluminum system designed for commercial and institutional use" 
              : "Sistema completo de aluminio diseñado para uso comercial e institucional"}
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-wood-600 dark:text-wood-400">S/. 4,100</span>
            <span class="bg-primary-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium group-hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors">
              {Astro.currentLocale === "en" ? "View Details" : "Ver Detalles"}
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
